    "sentence_translations": [
      "Does Little Le often get jealous?",
      "",
      "Lili: Paul, does your girlfriend Little Le often get jealous?",
      "",
      "Paul: Yes.",
      "",
      "Lili: When? Does she get jealous when you talk with other girls?",
      "",
      "Paul: She likes to have vinegar when she eats dumplings.",
      "",
      "Lili: Oh dear, Paul!",
      "What I’m talking about here isn’t actual “vinegar”; “eating vinegar” also has the meaning of being jealous.",
      "I want to ask you, for example when Little Le sees you with other girls, will she get jealous? Will she get angry?",
      "",
      "Paul: It seems that she doesn’t really. Then she doesn’t get jealous. I get jealous.",
      "",
      "Lili: Oh? You do?",
      "",
      "Paul: Yeah. I don’t like it when Little Le talks to other boys, I don’t like it when she eats with other boys.",
      "I like it even less when she watches movies with other boys.",
      "",
      "Lili: Oh my God! You really are a jealous person!",
      ""
